<<
/Title (Layer 3 switch withSVIs \(Switched Virtual Interfaces\): the core switch itself has routing capability andavirtual interface per VLAN, routing between departments internally at wire speed.This is the modern standard for anything beyond a very small deployment, since itavoids the router-on-a-stick bottleneck.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 470 0 R
/Prev 480 0 R
>>
